==English==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|non}} {{term|hoggva||to strike, to cut|lang=non}}. "Hog" originally meant a [[castrate]]d male pig. (Compare "[[hoggett]]" for a castrated male sheep.)

===Pronunciation===
{{rfap}}
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/hɒɡ/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/hɑːg/|/hɔːg/}}
* {{rhymes|ɒɡ}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any animal belonging to the [[Suidae]] family of mammals, especially the [[pig]], the [[wart hog]], and the [[boar]].
# A [[greedy]] person; one who refuses to share.
# {{slang}} A large motorcycle, particularly a [[w:Harley Davidson|Harley-Davidson]].

===Verb===
{{en-verb|hogg|ing}}

# {{transitive}} To [[greedily]] take more than one's share.
#: ''Hey! Quit '''hogging''' all the blankets.''

====Derived terms====
* [[road hog]] (someone who drives dangerously without caring about others)

